    {
      "id": "legal",
      "type": "section",
      "props": {
        "width": "boxed",
        "paddingY": 0
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "legal-row",
          "type": "row",
          "props": {
            "gap": 0,
            "stackOn": "never"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "legal-col",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 12
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "legal-title",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Tax & Payout Overview",
                    "headingLevel": 1
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "meta",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For Peace In Pressure athletes",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-1",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How Athlete Earnings Work",
                    "headingLevel": 3
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Peace in Pressure is a <strong>for-profit marketplace</strong>.Athletes receive a <strong>25% revenue share</strong> from card sales as independent participants (not employees).\n\nPeace in Pressure does <strong>not</strong> provide tax advice. Athletes are responsible for reporting income in their country of residence.\n\nPayouts and tax forms are handled through <strong>Stripe</strong>. Stripe collects your identity, bank details and tax form directly. Peace in Pressure never sees or stores your bank information.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-3",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Revenue Share Basics",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Net revenue from card sales is split as follows\n\n<strong>Peace in Pressure:</strong> 75%\n\n<strong>Athlete:</strong> 25%\n\nAny required tax withholding applies <strong>only to the athlete’s portion</strong>",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-5",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "U.S. vs Non-U.S. Athletes",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "U.S.-Based Athletes",
                    "headingLevel": 3
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Submit a <strong>W-9</strong> through Stripe\n\nReceive full 25% payout\n\nMay receive a <strong>1099</strong> at year end if earnings exceed IRS thresholds\n\nNo tax is withheld by Peace in Pressure",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-8",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Non-U.S. Athletes",
                    "headingLevel": 3
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-9",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Submit a <strong>W-8BEN</strong> (individual) or <strong>W-8BEN-E</strong> (entity) through Stripe\n\nU.S. law may require <strong>withholding on athlete earnings</strong>\n\nDefault withholding rate: <strong>30% of the athlete’s share</strong>\n\nWithholding may be <strong>reduced or eliminated</strong> if a tax treaty applies",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-10",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Tax Treaties (Important)",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-11",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The United States has tax treaties with many countries, including most of Europe, Canada, Australia, Japan, and others.\n\nIf your country has a treaty:",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-12",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "You may claim a <strong>reduced withholding rate</strong> (often 0–10%)\n\nYou must indicate this on your <strong>W-8 form</strong> in Stripe\n\nPeace in Pressure applies the rate you declare",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "t-13",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If no treaty is claimed:",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-14",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "30% withholding is applied to the athlete portion only",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-15",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Example (Non-U.S. Athlete, No Treaty)",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-16",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Net revenue from a sale: $200\n\nAthlete share (25%): $50\n\nIRS withholding (30%): $15\n\nAthlete receives: $35\n\nPeace in Pressure keeps: $150 (unchanged)",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-17",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Key Points to Understand",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-18",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Peace in Pressure <strong>does not tax athletes</strong>\n\nRequired withholding is a <strong>prepayment of the athlete’s tax</strong>, not a fee\n\nWithheld funds are remitted to the IRS, not kept by PIP\n\nAthletes may be able to reclaim withheld tax through their local tax process",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-19",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Peace in Pressure Handles",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-20",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Collecting required tax forms (W-9 / W-8) through Stripe\n\nApplying withholding only when legally required\n\nIssuing required U.S. tax reporting forms\n\nProcessing monthly payouts through Stripe",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-21",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Athletes Are Responsible For",
                    "headingLevel": 2
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ul-22",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Submitting accurate tax information\n\nClaiming treaty benefits if applicable\n\nReporting income to local tax authorities\n\nConsulting a tax professional if needed",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-23",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Questions?",
                    "headingLevel": 3
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3a-24",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you have questions about forms or payouts, contact: <a href=\"mailto:info@peaceinpressure.com\">info@peaceinpressure.com</a>",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
